# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF（pi 的 session JSONL 解析对 CRLF 敏感，测试也按 LF 断言）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制/非文本，禁止换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.asar binary
*.zip binary

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 锁文件不参与 diff 折叠统计
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
